Project Context for Another AI
What We're Building
We're implementing a workflow approval system for a construction project management application. The system has different user roles that need to approve project items (BOQs) in a specific sequence.
Workflow Requirements

Sub Contractors submit project items
Main Contractors approve submitted items
Sub Consultants approve contractor-approved items
Main Consultants approve subconsultant-approved items
Final status becomes "published" when fully approved
Any role can request modifications (reject) which moves workflow one step back
Comments are required when requesting modifications
Notifications sent at each approval step

Database Schema Changes Needed

Add to project_items table:

status (text): pending, contractor_approved, subconsultant_approved, consultant_approved, published, modification_requested
comments (text): for modification requests
submitted_by (uuid): who submitted the item
reviewed_by (uuid): who last reviewed it
reviewed_at (timestamp): when last reviewed



